WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.700
Use a tag when a cross-cutting label such as sound check would help colleagues recognise the work.

00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:11.100
Add the short label in Resolution Center, press Enter and verify it under Details.

00:00:11.100 --> 00:00:17.605
Compare it with the category: a tag can describe a test, but it cannot correct a wrongly routed intake.
